     <span class="dvc">
      <var>x</var>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      3
     </span>
     ;
     <span class="dvc">
      <var>h</var>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      2
     </span>
     <span class="b1">)</span>
     <span class="b1">)</span>
     =
     <b>min</b>
     <span class="b1">(</span>
     2.5 ·  ( 650
     <i>mm</i>
     − 605
     <i>mm</i>
     ) ;
     <b>min</b>
     <span class="b1">(</span>
     650
     <i>mm</i>
     −
     <span class="dvc">
      254.42
      <i>mm</i>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      3
     </span>
     ;
     <span class="dvc">
      650
      <i>mm</i>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      2
     </span>
     <span class="b1">)</span>
     <span class="b1">)</span>
     = 112.5
     <i>mm</i>
    </span>
   </p>
   <p>Concrete effective area within tensile zone</p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>A</var>
     <sub>c_eff</sub>
     =
     <var>b</var>
     ·
     <var>h</var>
     <sub>c_eff</sub>
     = 300
     <i>mm</i>
     · 112.5
     <i>mm</i>
     = 33750
     <i>mm</i>
     <sup class="unit">2</sup>
    </span>
   </p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>ρ</var>
     <sub>p_eff</sub>
     =
     <span class="dvc">
      <var>A</var>
      <sub>s1</sub>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      <var>A</var>
      <sub>c_eff</sub>
     </span>
     =
     <span class="dvc">
      1256.64
      <i>mm</i>
      <sup class="unit">2</sup>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      33750
      <i>mm</i>
      <sup class="unit">2</sup>
     </span>
     = 0.0372
    </span>
   </p>
   <p class="ref">[EN 1992-1-1 §7.3.4(3)]</p>
   <p>
    For
    <span class="eq">
     <var>s</var>
     = 74
     <i>mm</i>
    </span>
    ≤
    <span class="eq">
     5 ·
     <span class="b1">(</span>
     <var>c</var>
     +
     <span class="dvc">
      <var>Φ</var>
      <sub>1</sub>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      2
     </span>
     <span class="b1">)</span>
     = 5 ·
     <span class="b1">(</span>
     30
     <i>mm</i>
     +
     <span class="dvc">
      20
      <i>mm</i>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      2
     </span>
     <span class="b1">)</span>
     = 200
     <i>mm</i>
    </span>
    :
   </p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>k</var>
     <sub>1</sub>
     = 0.8
    </span>
    - for high bond bars
   </p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>k</var>
     <sub>2</sub>
     = 0.5
    </span>
    - for bending
   </p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>k</var>
     <sub>3</sub>
     = 3.4
    </span>
    ,
    <span class="eq">
     <var>k</var>
     <sub>4</sub>
     = 0.425
    </span>
   </p>
   <p>Maximum final crack spacing</p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>s</var>
     <sub>r_max</sub>
     =
     <var>k</var>
     <sub>3</sub>
     ·
     <var>c</var>
     +
     <span class="dvc">
      <var>k</var>
      <sub>1</sub>
      ·
      <var>k</var>
      <sub>2</sub>
      ·
      <var>k</var>
      <sub>4</sub>
      ·
      <var>Φ</var>
      <sub>1</sub>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      <var>ρ</var>
      <sub>p_eff</sub>
     </span>
     = 3.4 · 30
     <i>mm</i>
     +
     <span class="dvc">
      0.8 · 0.5 · 0.425 · 20
      <i>mm</i>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      0.0372
     </span>
     = 193.32
     <i>mm</i>
    </span>
   </p>
   <p>The check is performed for quasi-permanent combination</p>
   <p>Reinforcement stress</p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>σ</var>
     <sub>s</sub>
     =
     <span class="dvc">
      <var>α</var>
      <sub>e</sub>
      ·
      <var>M</var>
      <sub>qp</sub>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      <var>I</var>
      <sub>red_II</sub>
     </span>
     ·  (
     <var>d</var>
     −
     <var>x</var>
     )  =
     <span class="dvc">
      25.82 · 150
      <i>kNm</i>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      5982777984
      <i>mm</i>
      <sup class="unit">4</sup>
     </span>
     ·  ( 605
     <i>mm</i>
     − 254.42
     <i>mm</i>
     )  = 226.92
     <i>MPa</i>
    </span>
   </p>
   <p>
    Long-term load factor -
    <span class="eq">
     <var>k</var>
     <sub>t</sub>
     = 0.4
    </span>
   </p>
   <p class="ref">[EN 1992-1-1 §7.3.4(2)]</p>
   <p>Difference between mean values of concrete and reinforcement strains</p>
   <p>
    <i>ε</i>
    <sub>sm</sub>
    -
    <i>ε</i>
    <sub>cm</sub>
    =
    <span class="eq">
     <var>Δε</var>
     =
     <span class="dvc up">
      <b>max</b>
      <span class="b1">(</span>
      <var>σ</var>
      <sub>s</sub>
      −
      <span class="dvc">
       <var>k</var>
       <sub>t</sub>
       ·
       <var>f</var>
       <sub>ct_eff</sub>
       <span class="dvl">
       </span>
       <var>ρ</var>
       <sub>p_eff</sub>
      </span>
      ·  ( 1 +
      <var>α</var>
      ·
      <var>ρ</var>
      <sub>p_eff</sub>
      ) ; 0.6 ·
      <var>σ</var>
      <sub>s</sub>
      <span class="b1">)</span>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      <var>E</var>
      <sub>s</sub>
     </span>
     =
     <span class="dvc up">
      <b>max</b>
      <span class="b1">(</span>
      226.92
      <i>MPa</i>
      −
      <span class="dvc">
       0.4 · 2.21
       <i>MPa</i>
       <span class="dvl">
       </span>
       0.0372
      </span>
      ·  ( 1 + 6.68 · 0.0372 ) ; 0.6 · 226.92
      <i>MPa</i>
      <span class="b1">)</span>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      200
      <i>GPa</i>
     </span>
     = 0.000986
    </span>
   </p>
   <p class="ref">[EN 1992-1-1 §7.3.4(1)]</p>
   <p>Crack widths</p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>w</var>
     <sub>k</sub>
     =
     <var>s</var>
     <sub>r_max</sub>
     ·
     <var>Δε</var>
     = 193.32
     <i>mm</i>
     · 0.000986 = 0.191
     <i>mm</i>
    </span>
   </p>
   <p class="ref">[EN 1992-1-1 §7.3.1(5)]</p>
   <p>Limiting crack width value</p>
   <p class="ref">[EN 1992-1-1, Table NA.4]</p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>w</var>
     <sub>max</sub>
     = 0.4
     <i>mm</i>
    </span>
    - for exposure classes X0, XC1
   </p>
   <p>Crack width limitation</p>
  </div>
  <p>
   <span class="eq">
    <var>w</var>
    <sub>k</sub>
    = 0.191
    <i>mm</i>
   </span>
   ≤
   <span class="eq">
    <var>w</var>
    <sub>max</sub>
    = 0.4
    <i>mm</i>
   </span>
   - The condition is satisfied!
  </p>
  <p>
  </p>
  <div class="fold">
   <h4>Control of deflections</h4>
   <p>Crack opening moment</p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>M</var>
     <sub>cr</sub>
     =
     <span class="dvc">
      <var>f</var>
      <sub>ctm</sub>
      ·
      <var>I</var>
      <sub>red</sub>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      <var>z</var>
      <sub>c</sub>
     </span>
     =
     <span class="dvc">
      2.21
      <i>MPa</i>
      · 9832414931
      <i>mm</i>
      <sup class="unit">4</sup>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      295.86
      <i>mm</i>
     </span>
     = 73.46
     <i>kNm</i>
    </span>
   </p>
   <p>Coefficient for duration of loads</p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>β</var>
     = 0.5
    </span>
    - for long-term loads
   </p>
   <p class="ref">[EN 1992-1-1 §7.4.3(3)]</p>
   <p>Distribution coefficient</p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>ζ</var>
     = 1 −
     <var>β</var>
     ·
     <span class="b1">(</span>
     <span class="dvc">
      <var>M</var>
      <sub>cr</sub>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      <var>M</var>
      <sub>qp</sub>
     </span>
     <span class="b1">)</span>
     <sup class="raised">2</sup>
     = 1 − 0.5 ·
     <span class="b1">(</span>
     <span class="dvc">
      73.46
      <i>kNm</i>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      150
      <i>kNm</i>
     </span>
     <span class="b1">)</span>
     <sup class="raised">2</sup>
     = 0.88
    </span>
    - for cracked section
   </p>
   <p>
    <b>Calculation of curvature</b>
   </p>
   <p>First moment of reinforcement area about centroid of uncracked section</p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>S</var>
     =
     <var>A</var>
     <sub>s1</sub>
     ·  (
     <var>z</var>
     <sub>c</sub>
     −
     <var>d</var>
     <sub>1</sub>
     )  −
     <var>A</var>
     <sub>s2</sub>
     ·  (
     <var>h</var>
     −
     <var>z</var>
     <sub>c</sub>
     −
     <var>d</var>
     <sub>2</sub>
     )  = 1256.64
     <i>mm</i>
     <sup class="unit">2</sup>
     ·  ( 295.86
     <i>mm</i>
     − 45
     <i>mm</i>
     )  − 307.88
     <i>mm</i>
     <sup class="unit">2</sup>
     ·  ( 650
     <i>mm</i>
     − 295.86
     <i>mm</i>
     − 45
     <i>mm</i>
     )  = 220070
     <i>mm</i>
     <sup class="unit">3</sup>
    </span>
   </p>
   <p>Curvature due to shrinkage of uncracked section</p>
   <p class="ref">[EN 1992-1-1 §7.4.3(6)]</p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>θ</var>
     <sub>cs_I</sub>
     =
     <span class="dvc">
      <var>ε</var>
      <sub>cs</sub>
      ·
      <var>α</var>
      <sub>e</sub>
      ·
      <var>S</var>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      <var>I</var>
      <sub>red</sub>
     </span>
     =
     <span class="dvc">
      0.000484 · 25.82 · 220070
      <i>mm</i>
      <sup class="unit">3</sup>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      9832414931
      <i>mm</i>
      <sup class="unit">4</sup>
     </span>
     = 2.8×10
     <sup>-7</sup>
     <i>mm</i>
     <sup class="unit">-1</sup>
    </span>
   </p>
   <p>Curvature of uncracked section</p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>θ</var>
     <sub>I</sub>
     =
     <span class="dvc">
      <var>M</var>
      <sub>qp</sub>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      <var>E</var>
      <sub>c_eff</sub>
      ·
      <var>I</var>
      <sub>red</sub>
     </span>
     +
     <var>θ</var>
     <sub>cs_I</sub>
     =
     <span class="dvc">
      150
      <i>kNm</i>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      7.75
      <i>GPa</i>
      · 9832414931
      <i>mm</i>
      <sup class="unit">4</sup>
     </span>
     + 2.8×10
     <sup>-7</sup>
     <i>mm</i>
     <sup class="unit">-1</sup>
     = 2.25×10
     <sup>-6</sup>
     <i>mm</i>
     <sup class="unit">-1</sup>
    </span>
   </p>
   <p>First moment of reinforcement area about centroid of cracked section</p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>S</var>
     =
     <var>A</var>
     <sub>s1</sub>
     ·  (
     <var>d</var>
     −
     <var>x</var>
     )  −
     <var>A</var>
     <sub>s2</sub>
     ·  (
     <var>x</var>
     −
     <var>d</var>
     <sub>2</sub>
     )  = 1256.64
     <i>mm</i>
     <sup class="unit">2</sup>
     ·  ( 605
     <i>mm</i>
     − 254.42
     <i>mm</i>
     )  − 307.88
     <i>mm</i>
     <sup class="unit">2</sup>
     ·  ( 254.42
     <i>mm</i>
     − 45
     <i>mm</i>
     )  = 376082
     <i>mm</i>
     <sup class="unit">3</sup>
    </span>
   </p>
   <p>Curvature due to shrinkage of cracked section</p>
   <p class="ref">[EN 1992-1-1 §7.4.3(6)]</p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>θ</var>
     <sub>cs_II</sub>
     =
     <span class="dvc">
      <var>ε</var>
      <sub>cs</sub>
      ·
      <var>α</var>
      <sub>e</sub>
      ·
      <var>S</var>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      <var>I</var>
      <sub>red_II</sub>
     </span>
     =
     <span class="dvc">
      0.000484 · 25.82 · 376082
      <i>mm</i>
      <sup class="unit">3</sup>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      5982777984
      <i>mm</i>
      <sup class="unit">4</sup>
     </span>
     = 7.86×10
     <sup>-7</sup>
     <i>mm</i>
     <sup class="unit">-1</sup>
    </span>
   </p>
   <p>Curvature of cracked section</p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>θ</var>
     <sub>II</sub>
     =
     <span class="dvc">
      <var>M</var>
      <sub>qp</sub>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      <var>E</var>
      <sub>c_eff</sub>
      ·
      <var>I</var>
      <sub>red_II</sub>
     </span>
     +
     <var>θ</var>
     <sub>cs_II</sub>
     =
     <span class="dvc">
      150
      <i>kNm</i>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      7.75
      <i>GPa</i>
      · 5982777984
      <i>mm</i>
      <sup class="unit">4</sup>
     </span>
     + 7.86×10
     <sup>-7</sup>
     <i>mm</i>
     <sup class="unit">-1</sup>
     = 4.02×10
     <sup>-6</sup>
     <i>mm</i>
     <sup class="unit">-1</sup>
    </span>
   </p>
   <p>Total curvature</p>
   <p class="ref">[EN 1992-1-1 §7.4.3(3)]</p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>θ</var>
     =
     <var>ζ</var>
     ·
     <var>θ</var>
     <sub>II</sub>
     +  ( 1 −
     <var>ζ</var>
     )  ·
     <var>θ</var>
     <sub>I</sub>
     = 0.88 · 4.02×10
     <sup>-6</sup>
     <i>mm</i>
     <sup class="unit">-1</sup>
     +  ( 1 − 0.88 )  · 2.25×10
     <sup>-6</sup>
     <i>mm</i>
     <sup class="unit">-1</sup>
     = 3.81×10
     <sup>-6</sup>
     <i>mm</i>
     <sup class="unit">-1</sup>
    </span>
   </p>
   <p>Factor considering the static scheme</p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>k</var>
     =
     <span class="dvc">
      5
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      48
     </span>
     = 0.104
    </span>
    - for simply supported beam with uniformly distributed load
   </p>
   <p>
    Deflection due to quasi-permanent combination -
    <span class="eq">
     <var>δ</var>
     =
     <var>k</var>
     ·
     <var>θ</var>
     ·
     <var>L</var>
     <sup>2</sup>
     = 0.104 · 3.81×10
     <sup>-6</sup>
     <i>mm</i>
     <sup class="unit">-1</sup>
     ·  ( 7
     <i>m</i>
     )
     <sup>2</sup>
     = 19.45
     <i>mm</i>
    </span>
   </p>
   <p class="ref">[EN 1992-1-1 §7.4.1(4)]</p>
   <p>
    Maximum deflection -
    <span class="eq">
     <var>δ</var>
     <sub>max</sub>
     =
     <span class="dvc">
      <var>L</var>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      250
     </span>
     =
     <span class="dvc">
      7
      <i>m</i>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      250
     </span>
     = 28
     <i>mm</i>
    </span>
   </p>
   <p>Deflection check:</p>
  </div>
  <p>
   <span class="eq">
    <var>δ</var>
    = 19.45
    <i>mm</i>
   </span>
   ≤
   <span class="eq">
    <var>δ</var>
    <sub>max</sub>
    = 28
    <i>mm</i>
   </span>
   - The condition is satisfied!
  </p>
 </div>
